# HOOKS.md

Automated guardrails from the agentic-workflow plugin. In **both** harnesses the
hooks run from this project (Cursor loads hooks only from project/user/team/
enterprise `hooks.json` — never from plugins):

- **Claude Code:** scripts symlinked at `.claude/hooks/`, wired in
  `.claude/settings.json` (both created by bootstrap).
- **Cursor:** scripts symlinked at `.cursor/hooks/`, wired in `.cursor/hooks.json`
  (both created by bootstrap).

| Location | Path |
|---|---|
| Claude Code (active) | `.claude/hooks/*.sh` + `.claude/settings.json` |
| Cursor (active) | `.cursor/hooks/*.sh` + `.cursor/hooks.json` |

## What runs when

| Script | Cursor event | Claude Code event | Effect |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dep-age-guard.sh` (Cursor: via `cursor-shell-guard.sh`) | `beforeShellExecution` | `PreToolUse` (Bash) | Blocks `npm`/`pnpm`/`yarn`/`bun`/`pip` installs of packages published <14 days ago. Claude Code: exit 2. Cursor: `{"permission":"deny"}` verdict with the reason |
| `format-changed.sh` | `afterFileEdit` | `PostToolUse` (Edit\|Write) | Best-effort Prettier on the edited file; never fails the turn |
| `run-tests.sh` (Cursor: via `cursor-stop-tests.sh`) | `stop` | `Stop` | Runs the project test suite (npm/pnpm/yarn/bun/pytest). Claude Code: failure blocks the stop (exit 2) so the agent keeps fixing. Cursor: stop can't block — failure sends a `followup_message` so the agent keeps iterating (capped by `loop_limit`, default 5). `RUN_TESTS_SKIP=1` bypasses both |

## Wiring (reference)

Claude Code (`.claude/settings.json` — written by bootstrap if absent; merge this
block manually if you already had a settings file):

```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      { "matcher": "Bash", "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/dep-age-guard.sh" } ] }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      { "matcher": "Edit|Write", "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/format-changed.sh" } ] }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      { "hooks": [ { "type": "command", "command": "\"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\"/.claude/hooks/run-tests.sh" } ] }
    ]
  }
}
```

Cursor (`.cursor/hooks.json` — written by bootstrap if absent; project hooks run
from the project root, so paths are project-relative):

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "hooks": {
    "beforeShellExecution": [
      { "command": ".cursor/hooks/cursor-shell-guard.sh", "matcher": "npm|pnpm|yarn|bun|pip" }
    ],
    "afterFileEdit": [
      { "command": ".cursor/hooks/format-changed.sh" }
    ],
    "stop": [
      { "command": ".cursor/hooks/cursor-stop-tests.sh" }
    ]
  }
}
```

## Scripts (symlinked)

- `.claude/hooks/`: `dep-age-guard.sh`, `format-changed.sh`, `run-tests.sh`
- `.cursor/hooks/`: the same three, plus the Cursor adapters
  `cursor-shell-guard.sh` and `cursor-stop-tests.sh` (translate the shared
  scripts' exit codes into Cursor's JSON hook responses)

Override the symlink source with `AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_HOOKS=/path/to/hooks` (Cursor) or
`AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_CLAUDE_PLUGIN=/path/to/plugins/core-workflow` (Claude Code) if needed.
